OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to MBE recipients
OL,4,Akilled in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to an elderly
OL,7,Fcouple, both MBE recipients, who were
OL,8,Fkilled in a car crash in North
OL,9,FYorkshire at the weekend.
OL,11,FAlan Charlton, 90, and Joy McCulloch,
OL,12,F74, died when their grey Peugeot 2008
OL,13,Fcollided with a VW Golf near Scaling
OL,14,FDam on the A171, between Whitby and
OL,15,FGuisborough, on Friday.
OL,17,FNorth Yorkshire said Joy, who was a
OL,18,Fpassenger in the car, was pronounced
OL,19,Fdead at the scene while Alan, who was
OL,20,Fdriving, was taken to hospital but
OL,21,Flater died as a result of his injuries.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
